        {
          "name": "bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[embedding_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_mean",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[embedding_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_var",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[embedding_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "eps",
          "kind": "float",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, embedding_dim, height, width, depth]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.bn(x)，在模型 eval 模式下（training=False），使用 running_mean 和 running_var 做归一化。",
        "计算公式：y = (x - running_mean) / sqrt(running_var + eps) * weight + bias。",
        "归一化在通道维 embedding_dim 上进行，与 BatchNorm3d 的语义一致。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "permute_bn3d_to_4d",
